      "source_file": "icrs/202602-0607-001/raw/supporting-statement-a-1.txt",
      "preceding_text": "The ABS will be mailed to approximately 230,000 respondents. For businesses, the sample will yield summary-level estimates for businesses by owner characteristics at the NAICS sector level, and by U.S., state, metropolitan statistical area (MSA), county, and congressional district. Response times will vary for selected respondents. The estimated time to complete for employer for-profit businesses increases from 29 minutes to 45 minutes due to expanded innovation content. This expanded innovation content was previously approved in ABS as rotating content. For those businesses that would have previously received the separate BERD survey (and now will be asked those questions on the ABS), the estimated time to complete is the BERD burden (2 Hours and 37 Minutes) plus 45 minutes. The estimated time to complete for nonprofit organizations remains unchanged at 38 minutes.",
